description:
Enfield Council is seeking to appoint a single suitably qualified Consultant to deliver stock condition surveys across its housing stock of approximately 15,800 properties, which include tenanted, leasehold and high-rise blocks. The surveys will refresh the Council’s stock condition data in its Apex asset management system and support the following:
its 30-year Business Plan and Housing Asset Management and Sustainability Strategy;
Decent Homes Standard and HHSRS compliance;
